409
00:38:26,214 --> 00:38:29,259
"Kier invites you to drink of his water."

410
00:38:30,384 --> 00:38:32,636
-Irving.
-Felicia said you'd be here.

411
00:38:32,720 --> 00:38:33,721
Mmm.

412
00:38:35,723 --> 00:38:39,685
Is it awful to say I
don't care for that one?

413
00:38:40,186 --> 00:38:41,187
No.

414
00:38:41,938 --> 00:38:45,191
Honestly, it makes me nervous too. Uh-huh.

415
00:38:46,901 --> 00:38:49,903
Such a lovely vista, but I keep thinking…

416
00:38:49,987 --> 00:38:51,195
IRVING: He could slip.

417
00:38:51,279 --> 00:38:52,530
BURT: Ah. Mmm.

418
00:38:55,033 --> 00:38:59,829
It was a thrill to have someone
from MDR come see us,

419
00:38:59,913 --> 00:39:02,499
to take an interest like you did, so…

420
00:39:03,625 --> 00:39:04,876
If I embarrassed myself…

421
00:39:04,960 --> 00:39:05,961
You didn't.

422
00:39:06,461 --> 00:39:09,422
-Hmm?
-Unless, you did?

423
00:39:10,423 --> 00:39:11,716
Are you embarrassed?

424
00:39:14,551 --> 00:39:15,552
No.

425
00:39:17,888 --> 00:39:18,889
Good.

426
00:39:21,600 --> 00:39:23,269
