456
00:41:30,890 --> 00:41:32,100
Mark?

457
00:41:33,768 --> 00:41:35,019
I'm gonna go.

458
00:41:35,103 --> 00:41:36,270
Do it.

459
00:41:36,354 --> 00:41:40,054
I'm working up till the bell. I think
I may still crush this thing tonight.

460
00:41:40,817 --> 00:41:41,901
I hope you do.

461
00:41:45,237 --> 00:41:46,238
See you soon.

462
00:42:48,547 --> 00:42:49,548
Knew it.

463
00:42:55,471 --> 00:43:00,559
Sometimes I ask people to
sculpt how they feel out of clay.

464
00:43:01,477 --> 00:43:03,479
Would you like to do that?

465
00:43:07,858 --> 00:43:08,858
