472
00:44:17,090 --> 00:44:19,217
<i>"E is for energy…</i>

473
00:44:21,219 --> 00:44:23,138
<i>"Breaking down walls."</i>

474
00:44:24,431 --> 00:44:26,683
"S is for stewardship,"

475
00:44:28,143 --> 00:44:30,843
-<i>of home and of earth."</i>
-[CLICKING, WHIRRING CONTINUES]

476
00:44:34,190 --> 00:44:38,402
<i>"T is for terror, which
gives us more worth.</i>

477
00:44:42,323 --> 00:44:44,241
<i>"I is for eyes,"</i>

478
00:44:45,701 --> 00:44:47,703
"which observe us with love."

479
00:44:50,205 --> 00:44:52,750
<i>"Until N, meaning newness,"</i>

480
00:44:53,709 --> 00:44:56,003
<i>"rains down from above."</i>

481
00:44:58,588 --> 00:44:59,589
<i>"And Y."</i>

482
00:45:00,590 --> 00:45:03,301
<i>"That's a question we needn't now ponder."</i>

483
00:45:04,552 --> 00:45:09,849
For destiny, friends,
shall deliver all yonder."

484
00:45:12,018 --> 00:45:13,811
Hey. How are you?

485
00:45:13,895 --> 00:45:15,187
Good.

486
00:45:15,271 --> 00:45:17,971
Yeah? Seems like you're
getting the hang of stuff here.

487
00:45:20,192 --> 00:45:21,401
Cool.

